  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 10.0.2: Added extensibility framework for enterprise features. Introduced three new interfaces (IResponseEnricher, IMetadataProvider, IResponseTransformer) that enable extension packages to enhance responses, inject custom metadata, and transform data before wrapping. This backward-compatible update provides foundation for upcoming extension packages including OpenAPI/Swagger integration, OpenTelemetry tracing, HTTP caching, and response transformation capabilities. Zero breaking changes - existing applications continue to work without modifications.",
